00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,861
Find the identity in each row: one plus three, two plus two, three plus one.

2
00:00:06,861 --> 00:00:11,002
So the inverse of one is three, two is its own inverse.

3
00:00:11,002 --> 00:00:17,708
And the table is a mirror image across its diagonal: the group is abelian, of order four.

